---
description: Choose the intended topic and exact reader windows from the editor's goal.
args:
  goal: string
  index: NewsEvidenceIndex
returns: NewsEvidenceChoice
---
Choose the exact current topic from the named desk and title. Choose the requested distinct views in the user's order. For archive use the selected topic's exact title as query. Keep an archive comparison separate from inbox, saved or backlog. Never choose a different reader to make an empty view nonempty.
